### 1. Create an item (POST) -> expect 201
# @name createItem
POST http://localhost:3000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk"
}

### 2. Get all items (GET) -> expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items

### 3. Get one item (GET) -> expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body._id}}

### 4. Update the item (PUT) -> expect 200
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body._id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### 5. Get the item again to see the change (GET) -> expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body._id}}

### 6. Delete the item (DELETE) -> expect 200
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body._id}}

### 7. Get the deleted item (GET) -> expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/items/{{createItem.response.body._id}}

### 8. Bad data (POST with no title) -> expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}